#ASSERT `s 7 the expression is used in conformity with its explanation` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7 the expression is used in conformity with its explanation` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7 the expression is used in conformity with its explanation` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

