#ASSERT `s 8 the pronoun is used of the person` she female EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8 the pronoun is used of the person` they male EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8 the pronoun is used of the person` they female EQUALS NOTHING

