#ASSERT `s 9 the other number` singular EQUALS plural
#ASSERT `s 9 the other number` plural EQUALS singular
-- unless the contrary appears from the context: the words do not include the other number (the text's own "unless")
#ASSERT `s 9 the words include the other number` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9 the words include the other number` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

